==Cast and characters==
=== Main ===
* [[Micah Abbey]] as [[Donatello (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles)|Donatello]]: The tech guru of the Turtles who uses a [[Bō|''bō'' staff]] in combat. He has a liking for anime and video games.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" />
* [[Shamon Brown Jr.]] as [[Michelangelo (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles)|Michelangelo]]: The fun-loving jokester of Turtles who uses [[Nunchaku|nunchucks]]. He desires to be a stand-up comedian.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" />
* [[Nicolas Cantu]] as [[Leonardo (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles)|Leonardo]]: The leader of the Turtles who uses two ''[[katana]]''. He has a romantic interest in [[April O'Neil]].<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" /><ref name="SlashFilmCharacters" />
* [[Brady Noon]] as [[Raphael (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles)|Raphael]]: The muscle of the Turtles who uses a pair of ''[[Sai (weapon)|sai]]''. He has a "fight first, ask questions later" attitude.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" /><ref name="ColliderCharacters" />
* [[Ayo Edebiri]] as [[April O'Neil]]: A high school news reporter and human friend of the Turtles.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" />
* [[Splinter (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles)|Splinter]] is a mutant rat and the adoptive father and mentor of the Turtles.<ref name="TheDirectCharacters" /> He was previously voiced by [[Jackie Chan]] in ''Mutant Mayhem'', but only speaks in a gibberish language called "vermin" in ''Tales''.<ref name="TheSpool2024Review" /> [[Fred Tatasciore]] provides the voice and is credited as "Splinter Vermin".<ref name="Season1Episode1" />

=== Recurring ===
* [[Rose Byrne]] as [[Leatherhead (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles)|Leatherhead]]: A mutant alligator and member of the [[Mighty Mutanimals|Mutanimals]], a group that allies with the Turtles. She used to be a member of Superfly's gang, the main villain in ''Mutant Mayhem''.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" />
* [[Natasia Demetriou]] as [[Wingnut and Screwloose|Wingnut]]: A mutant bat and the mechanical genius of the Mutanimals. She used to be a member of Superfly's gang and shares a close bond with Donatello.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" />
* [[Post Malone|Austin Post]] as [[Ray Fillet]]: A mutant manta ray and member of the Mutanimals. He used to be a member of Superfly's gang and mostly communicates by singing his name.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" />
* Amad Jackson as [[List of Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles characters#Genghis Frog|Genghis Frog]]: A mutant frog who wields a battle axe. He used to be a member of Superfly's gang.<ref name="Season1Episode8" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" /> Jackson replaces [[Hannibal Burress]] from ''Mutant Mayhem''.<ref name="VarietyMutantMayhemCast" />
* [[Alex Hirsch]] as [[List of Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles characters|Scumbug]]: A mutant cockroach and love interest of Splinter. She used to be a member of Superfly's gang.<ref name="Season1Episode7" /><ref name="TheDirectCharacters" /><ref name="ScreenRantScumbug" />
* [[Alanna Ubach]] as [[Agent Bishop|Bishop]]: A brilliant inventor who believes mutants are a threat to humanity.<ref name="FutonCritcTrailer" /> She is recruited by the Earth Protection Force (EPF).<ref name="Season1Episode6" />
* [[Pete Davidson]] as Rod: A lazy rich kid who desires to be a mutant.<ref name="FutonCritcTrailer" />
* [[Christopher Mintz-Plasse]] as [[Mighty_Mutanimals#Pigeon_Pete|Pigeon Pete]]: A mutant pigeon and member of the Mutanimals. He was mutated by a sample of Michelangelo's blood.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" />
* [[Timothy Olyphant]] as Goldfin: A mutant goldfish and leader of the villainous group the East River Three. The group was mutated when Superfly's machine fell into the ocean in ''Mutant Mayhem''.<ref name="FutonCriticCast2024" />
